;; Merge fixture C: carries a relation (onlyc) that mergea and the runner
;; program never declare -- the regression case for same-session
;; import-then-run (runStratum's orphan-relation restore must keep it
;; alive across the reload, since no compile-time manifest can know about
;; relations imported at runtime).

table (onlyc int int)
facts (onlyc 1 2) (onlyc 3 4)
